.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:103:      owner_after_creation: "The controller."
.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:104:      owner_during_operation: "Read-only for roles; the frozen bytes remain authority, and publication packages from them."
.kogen/intents/drafts/isolated-candidate-workspace/risks.yaml:105:      permitted_mutation: "None by roles. The controller removes it with the Candidate."
