   413	## Installing this Intent (self-hosting, D9)
   414	
   415	The installing Build runs under main's controller at `9ff7af6e` (#1, #2 and #4; #3 is parked), in
   416	the one checkout, not isolated, on `--route claude-dominant-adversarial-codex` (Claude Code
   417	Developer, Codex Reviewer and Expert), launched with every Kogen module preloaded
   418	(`mix run --no-start -e '… Code.ensure_loaded … Mix.Task.run("kogen.build", args)'`,
   419	build-failure lesson 17). It reads several files **from disk at run
   420	time**, so the Candidate must leave them byte-identical:
   421	
   422	- `.codex/hooks.json` and `.codex/hooks/**`. `VerificationPolicy.preflight`
   423	  byte-compares the PreToolUse command before every Developer launch
   424	  (`lib/kogen/verification_policy.ex:20,34-49,66-92` at `9ff7af6e`: #4's preflight requires only
   425	  `.codex/hooks/verification_policy.py` and the PreToolUse registration), and the Stop bootstrap
   426	  stays for v1 contexts until ROADMAP order 10.
   427	- `priv/kogen/claude_code/settings.json`, passed by path to every Claude launch
   428	  (`lib/kogen/harness/claude.ex:26,165-166` at `9ff7af6e`).
   429	- `priv/kogen/prompts/*.md`, read at each role launch.
   430	- `Makefile` and `priv/kogen/verification_targets.yaml` (#4 keeps them frozen).
   431	- `.kogen/config.yaml`.
   432	
   433	None of these are in `may_change_guarded_paths`. The installing Build itself
   434	never runs in a Candidate: then-main has no workspace admission, and Candidate
   435	code can't change the controller that runs it. The first real Candidate is
   436	created by the `live-shape-to-build` fixture Build inside this Build (running
   437	the Candidate's code), and then by the first ordinary Build after this lands. Everything this Intent adds
   438	is used only by the Candidate's own code: the Build's tests and the
   439	`live-shape-to-build` fixture Build. It is an expand step with nothing to
   440	contract later.
   441	
   442	- The inert Stop bootstrap and the `$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)`
   443	  PreToolUse command stay. Removing them is ROADMAP order 10.
   444	- The engine limitation stays. The controller of a later Build runs from
   445	  control's compiled code and reads control's `priv/`, so the Shaper editing
   446	  Kogen's own engine files in control during a Build can affect it. Pinned
   447	  generations are ROADMAP order 6.
   448	- Editing Drafts and other ignored files is safe.
   449	- **Lesson 17 (late-called controller modules).** This Intent edits modules main's controller
   450	  calls late: `Report`, `Tracking`, `ReviewPacket`, `Verification`, `Evidence`, `Git` and the
   451	  publication path in `build.ex`. The preloaded launch keeps the controller on its admission code,
   452	  and the Developer compiles only in `_build/test` or fixture build paths (Developer notes), so
   453	  neither mechanism alone is relied on. Nothing in this Intent needs the running controller to
   454	  load Candidate code, and nothing needs the application started (`mix run --no-start`): new code
   455	  reads no `priv/` file and no application env at runtime. After this Intent, each Candidate has
   456	  its own `_build/`, so a Developer compile can no longer reach the controller's code; only a
   457	  compile in control can (order 6).
   458	- The installing Build's own roles run without a write boundary, because then-main has none.
   459	  The boundary first confines the nested fixture Builds of `live-shape-to-build` and
   460	  `live-reviewer-rework` (Candidate code, launched by the controller's unconfined `make`), and
   461	  then the first ordinary Build after this lands. No `.claude/settings.json` is added to this
   462	  repository: `--setting-sources project` would load it into the installing Build's own roles.
   463	  The SessionStart probe lives only in the live fixture's copy.
   464	
   465	While this installing Build runs, **no session may write in the checkout**,
   466	because the running controller still guards the one checkout.
