   750	  `test/support/live_reviewer_rework_fixture.ex`, is edited here, and no other target
   751	  runs a real Codex role through a Kogen Build. DIRECTION D8 allows a second paid
   752	  target for a provider-only observable, and this is one. It also closes the old
   753	  `unrun-live-targets` gap for that target.
