      authenticated turn cannot be shown by a fake, and live-shape-to-build runs no Codex role
    affected_paths: [lib/kogen/build/write_boundary.ex, lib/kogen/harness/codex.ex, lib/kogen/codex.ex, lib/kogen/codex/state.ex, lib/kogen/codex/environment.ex, lib/mix/tasks/kogen.expert.ex, test/kogen/write_boundary_test.exs, test/kogen/codex_environment_test.exs, test/kogen/harness_role_test.exs, test/support/live_reviewer_rework_fixture.ex, test/support/fake_codex, README.md, workflows/codex-runtime-upgrade.md, priv/kogen/test-reliability.yaml, priv/kogen/test-reliability-remediation.yaml]

