   140	
   141	### R8. Which enforcement mechanism?
   142	
   143	A per-launch macOS Seatbelt profile, `/usr/bin/sandbox-exec -p <profile>`,
   144	wrapped around every Build role launch by Kogen's launcher. Probes on this host
