   157	  and Apple Events are not, so the profile denies `lsopen` and
   158	  `appleevent-send`.
   159	- Kogen's whole `make check` behaves identically inside the profile (probe 9).
   160	
   161	Rejected alternatives:
   162	
   163	- Claude Code's `permissions` or `sandbox` settings, and Codex's
   164	  `--sandbox workspace-write`. They govern tool calls, not the harness process's
   165	  own writes. Kogen launches both with bypass flags. Codex's Seatbelt can't
