    12	  it: that role's launch carries the frozen Expert assignment (harness, model,
    13	  effort and that harness's native helpers) in `KOGEN_EXPERT`. The task never
    14	  reads `.kogen/config.yaml`, never substitutes another harness, model or
    15	  effort, and fails naming the Expert role and harness when that harness is
